# Origin of the running OmniArena server. Vite proxies `/api` and `/health`
# here for both `npm run dev` and `npm run preview`.
#
# `vite.config.ts` reads this from `process.env`, and Vite does not load `.env`
# files into `process.env` — so export it in the shell rather than copying this
# file to `.env`:
#
#   ARENA_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:3011 npm run dev
ARENA_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:3001
